# 6-stage transparent URI process pipeline lifecycle for edialog.
LIFECYCLE edialog-pipeline VERSION 1
DESCRIPTION "Deterministyczny 6-etapowy potok procesowy edialog od parsowania NL do emisji kwitu CompositeExecutionReceipt"
STATE IDLE INITIAL
STATES [PARSED, CONTEXT_FILTERED, CANDIDATES_GENERATED, SCORED, DSL_COMPILED]
STATES [REPORTED, FAILED] TERMINAL
EVENTS [PARSE_NL, FILTER_CONTEXT, GENERATE_CANDIDATES, SCORE_AFFECT, COMPILE_DSL, EMIT_REPORT, FAIL]
EVIDENCES [ACTION_URI_COMPILED, VISIBLE_CONTEXT_COMPUTED, CANDIDATE_POOL_VALIDATED, RANK_LOSS_SORTED, REPLAY_VERIFIED, COMPOSITE_RECEIPT_EMITTED, DIAGNOSTIC_ERROR_RECORDED]
TRANSITION IDLE -> PARSED ON PARSE_NL REQUIRES ACTION_URI_COMPILED
TRANSITION PARSED -> CONTEXT_FILTERED ON FILTER_CONTEXT REQUIRES VISIBLE_CONTEXT_COMPUTED
TRANSITION CONTEXT_FILTERED -> CANDIDATES_GENERATED ON GENERATE_CANDIDATES REQUIRES CANDIDATE_POOL_VALIDATED
TRANSITION CANDIDATES_GENERATED -> SCORED ON SCORE_AFFECT REQUIRES RANK_LOSS_SORTED
TRANSITION SCORED -> DSL_COMPILED ON COMPILE_DSL REQUIRES REPLAY_VERIFIED
TRANSITION DSL_COMPILED -> REPORTED ON EMIT_REPORT REQUIRES COMPOSITE_RECEIPT_EMITTED
TRANSITION [IDLE, PARSED, CONTEXT_FILTERED, CANDIDATES_GENERATED, SCORED, DSL_COMPILED] -> FAILED ON FAIL REQUIRES DIAGNOSTIC_ERROR_RECORDED
REJECT IDLE ON EMIT_REPORT WITH EDIALOG-LIFECYCLE-001
REJECT PARSED ON EMIT_REPORT WITH EDIALOG-LIFECYCLE-002
REJECT CANDIDATES_GENERATED ON COMPILE_DSL WITH EDIALOG-LIFECYCLE-003
ERROR EDIALOG-LIFECYCLE-001 SEVERITY ERROR MESSAGE "Potok nie może wyemitować raportu przed wykonaniem etapów analizy i punktacji."
ERROR EDIALOG-LIFECYCLE-002 SEVERITY ERROR MESSAGE "Sama kompilacja Action URI nie wystarcza do emisji raportu końcowego."
ERROR EDIALOG-LIFECYCLE-003 SEVERITY ERROR MESSAGE "Kompilacja DSL wymaga wcześniejszego ocenienia i posortowania kandydatów (rank_loss)."
END
